=== Mongolian People's Revolutionary Party ===
The MPRP had originally selected former president [[Nambaryn Enkhbayar]] as its candidate at the MPRP's XVI party conference on 5 May.<ref>{{Cite web |last=А |first=Төгөлдөр |date=2017-05-05 |title=Н.Энхбаяр: Ард түмэнтэйгээ хамтран энэ сонгуульд идэвхтэй оролцоно |url=https://ikon.mn/n/104d |access-date=2026-02-16 |website=ikon.mn |language=mn}}</ref> However, the GEC refused to allow Enkhbayar to run as a candidate as he had an outstanding criminal record and had not spent the last five years in the country, having lived abroad from August 2013 until October 2014.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Б |first=Ану |date=2017-05-15 |title=ТАНИЛЦ: Намбарын Энхбаярыг СЕХ бүртгээгүй ГУРВАН ШАЛТГААН БА ТҮҮНИЙ БАРИМТ |url=https://ikon.mn/n/10dr |access-date=2026-02-16 |website=ikon.mn |language=mn}}</ref> As a result, the party selected a non-MPRP member and former chairperson of the [[National Labour Party (Mongolia)|National Labour Party]], [[Sainkhuugiin Ganbaatar]], as its candidate on 16 May.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Б |first=Ану |date=2017-05-16 |title=Ерөнхийлөгчийн сонгуульд МАХН-аас С.Ганбаатарыг нэр дэвшүүлэхээр боллоо |url=https://ikon.mn/n/10ep |access-date=2026-02-16 |website=ikon.mn |language=mn}}</ref> Prior on 6 May, Ganbaatar did not rule out the possibility of running as the MPRP candidate on a [[TV9 Mongolia|TV9]] broadcast.<ref>{{Cite web |last= |first= |date=2017-05-05 |title=С.Ганбаатар МАХН-аас Ерөнхийлөгчид өрсөлдөх үү |url=https://ikon.mn/n/103k |access-date=2026-02-16 |website=ikon.mn |language=mn}}</ref> The party's sole MP, [[Oktyabriin Baasankhüü]], opposed Ganbaatar's nomination and left the party on 17 May.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Г |first=Мөрөн |date=2017-05-17 |title=О.Баасанхүү: С.Ганбаатар хэзээ, аль намаас гараад МАХН-д орсон нь мэдэгдэхгүй байна |url=https://ikon.mn/n/10g9 |access-date=2026-02-17 |website=ikon.mn |language=mn}}</ref>
