== Registered candidates ==
On 11 May, the GEC received all the registration documents from the three nominees — Enkhbold (MPP), Battulga (DP), and Enkhbayar (MPRP). The GEC announced its decision to register Enkhbold and Battulga and reject Enkhbayar's registration on 14 May.<ref name=":5" /> Subsequently, after the MPRP nominated Ganbaatar on 16 May, the GEC officially registered Ganbaatar's candidacy on 18 May.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Т |first=Өлзийбаяр |date=2017-05-18 |title="Оюутолгойн мэтгэлцээнээс хойш хэн нь илүү боловсролтой нь харагдаж байгаа байх" |url=https://ikon.mn/n/10hu |access-date=2026-02-17 |website=ikon.mn |language=mn}}</ref> The candidate's orders were ordered according to the amount of party seats in parliament.
